Other components of the container image and the frontend

The container image contains the CA certificate bundle of Alpine Linux
(package ca-certificates-bundle) at /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt. The
certificates come from Mozilla's root store and are distributed under the
Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/); the source is
available from https://hg.mozilla.org/projects/nss and
https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/ca-certificates. The debug image adds
BusyBox (GPL-2.0-only, source at https://busybox.net/downloads/).

The frontend files under static/vendor/ and static/icons/ keep their own
license files next to them (for example static/vendor/terminal-fonts/licenses/
and static/vendor/UI-FONTS.md); they are embedded in the binary unchanged.
